{"scene_description":"The image depicts the interior of a warehouse or storage facility. The space is filled with various shelving units and racks, some of which are made of metal and others appear to be wooden. There are numerous boxes and crates stored on these shelves, including red plastic bins and cardboard boxes. A blue trash can is visible in the background, and there is a doorway leading to another area of the building. The floor is concrete, and the ceiling has exposed pipes and ducts. The overall atmosphere suggests an industrial setting."}

